            <img src="{{ 'exo2-app-native-kbm-2.webp' | asset_url }}" width="786" height="1704" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="ZeroStick app: Native, the game handles your sensitivity">
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="x2-card x2-card--glow" data-x2-glow data-reveal style="--d:.16s">
          <span class="x2l-pill x2l-pill--cyan">Pass-through</span>
          <h3 class="x2-h3">Type, chat, browse</h3>
          <p>One shortcut hands your keyboard and mouse straight to the console or PC for menus and chat, then brings your config back.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="x2-card x2-card--glow" data-x2-glow data-reveal>
          <span class="x2l-pill x2l-pill--blue">PS5 headset</span>
          <h3 class="x2-h3">Plug in where you always do</h3>
          <p>On PS5, plug your headset into your DualSense as normal. Game sound and your mic run through the EXO.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="x2-card x2-card--glow" data-x2-glow data-reveal style="--d:.08s">
          <span class="x2l-pill x2l-pill--blue">Configs</span>
          <h3 class="x2-h3">Switch without your phone</h3>
          <p>No slot limit. Hold Home and press Share/View (or L3) on your controller to jump to your next config.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="x2-card x2-card--glow" data-x2-glow data-reveal style="--d:.16s">
          <span class="x2l-pill x2l-pill--blue">Light</span>
          <h3 class="x2-h3">Always know what's on</h3>
          <p>Each config has a colour that lights the EXO's logo and your PlayStation controller's light bar.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

