  {%- comment -%} ===== 11. FAQ + FINE PRINT (uses the shared .x2-faq accordion) ===== {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="x2-sec" id="faq" style="padding-top:2rem">
    <div class="x2-wrap x2-narrow">
      <div class="x2-center">
        <p class="x2-eyebrow" data-reveal>FAQ</p>
        <h2 class="x2-h2" data-reveal style="--d:.06s">Good questions.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="x2-faq" style="margin-top:3.2rem">
        <details data-reveal><summary>Which consoles does it work with?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>PS5, Xbox Series X|S / Xbox One and PC. Pick the version for your console: the PS5 version includes the PS5 auth dongle; for the Xbox version you plug your own genuine Xbox controller into the AUTH port.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Is there a subscription or an account?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>No. It's a one-time purchase. The ZeroStick app is free and needs no account.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Do I need a PC to set it up?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>No. Everything is set up from the free ZeroStick app on your iPhone or Android phone, over Bluetooth. No Wi-Fi needed either.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Which controllers can I use?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>Plug in a DualSense, DualSense Edge, DualShock 4, Xbox Series or One controller, Switch Pro, 8BitDo or most USB pads, with a USB cable. Bluetooth controllers aren't supported at launch.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Can I use my own mouse and keyboard?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>Yes: your own gaming mouse and keyboard, wired or with their wireless dongle, in the front ports. A USB hub works if you need more ports.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Does automatic gun detection work in every game?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>It's Ready in Call of Duty: Black Ops II and Modern Warfare 4, and in progress in Warzone, Black Ops 7, Apex Legends, Fortnite, Rust, Battlefield 6 and Counter-Strike 2. It needs your console's HDMI to run through the EXO. Everything else (aim, remaps, Scripts, Pass-through) works in every game.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Will my headset work?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>On PS5, plug your headset into your DualSense as normal: game sound and your mic run through the EXO. USB headsets plugged into the EXO aren't supported.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Can I use it at tournaments?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>Follow the rules of each game, event and platform you play on. Tournament Mode switches every script off in one tap, and keeps your remaps and stick settings.</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>When does it ship, and can I cancel?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>{{ ship_line }}</p></div></details>
        <details data-reveal><summary>Where can I get help?</summary>
          <div class="x2-faq-a"><p>Read the <a href="{{ manual_url }}">ZeroStick EXO manual</a>, join the <a href="{{ discord_url }}" rel="noopener">ZeroStick Discord</a>, or email <a href="mailto:caleb@zerostickgaming.com">caleb@zerostickgaming.com</a>.</p></div></details>
      </div>

      <div class="x2-fine x2l-fine">
        <p><b>Pre-orders.</b> {{ ship_line }} Prices: Xbox version $149.99, PS5 version $169.99 (includes the PS5 auth dongle). One-time purchase, no subscription.</p>
        <p><b>Fair play.</b> Follow the rules of each game, event and platform you play on. Tournament Mode switches every script off in one tap.</p>
        <p><b>Game support.</b> "Ready" features are finished. "In progress" features work and are still being improved. Automatic gun detection and Auto green need your console's HDMI to run through the EXO. Auto green helps with shot timing; results depend on you and the game.</p>
        <p><b>Pictures.</b> Product images and the 3D model are renders of the final design; the logo lights in your config's colour (renders show neutral white). App screens are real captures of the ZeroStick app and may change before launch.</p>
        <p>Game titles are trademarks of their owners. PlayStation, PS5 and DualSense are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment; Xbox is a trademark of Microsoft. ZeroStick is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.</p>
        {%- if section.settings.show_fcc_notice -%}
          <p><b>FCC.</b> {{ fcc_text }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZeroStick EXO landing v2",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "zs-exo2-landing-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Links" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "preorder_url", "label": "Pre-order link", "default": "/products/zerostick-exo",
      "info": "Every Pre-order button goes here." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "games_url", "label": "Supported games page link", "default": "/pages/supported-games" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "manual_url", "label": "Manual page link", "default": "/pages/exo-manual" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "discord_url", "label": "Discord invite link", "default": "#discord-invite-placeholder",
      "info": "Placeholder until the real invite link is known. Paste the full https://discord.gg/... link here." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "app_store_url", "label": "App Store link (iPhone)", "default": "#app-store-placeholder",
      "info": "The 'Get it for iPhone' button stays hidden while this starts with #." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "play_store_url", "label": "Google Play link (Android)", "default": "#play-store-placeholder",
      "info": "The 'Get it for Android' button stays hidden while this starts with #." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Legal" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_fcc_notice", "label": "Show FCC pre-authorization notice", "default": false,
      "info": "Shows the FCC notice word for word next to the price and pre-order buttons, and in the fine print." }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
